<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Sherar Burn to Kinzel Lake</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:151-2: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.285259" lon="-121.727970"><ele>1156.8</ele><name>Trillium Lake Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:trillium-lake-sno-park (OSM parking way/148019331); confidence: high; pdf_page: 143; book_elev_ft: 3830</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.280208" lon="-121.733236"><ele>1103.1</ele><name>Airstrip junction</name><desc>source: as in or-vielbig-2e_142-2: OSM junction of Trillium Lake Road NF 2656 and NF 2650-131; confidence: high; pdf_page: 144; book_elev_ft: 3600</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.286242" lon="-121.737580"><ele>1117.5</ele><name>Pioneer Graves junction</name><desc>source: as in or-vielbig-2e_142-2: OSM junction of East Chimney Rock Road and NF 2650-131; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 145</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.280905" lon="-121.741343"><ele>1137.8</ele><name>Westside Divide</name><desc>source: OSM junction of Sherar Burn Road NF 2613 and Still Creek Road NF 2612 (as in 142-2); DEM 3,733 ft; confidence: high; pdf_page: 153; book_elev_ft: 3720; quote: Ski to the Westside Divide Junction west of Trillium Lake (see Trillium Lake Loop)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.247693" lon="-121.790028"><ele>1366.8</ele><name>Fir Tree Campground</name><desc>source: OSM NF 2613 node 3.72 mi from the divide (about 5.1 mi from the sno-park on this line); DEM 4,484 ft; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 154; book_elev_ft: 4500; quote: Ski the Sherar Burn road from the Westside Divide to Fir Tree Campground 5.1 miles from the sno-park.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.241583" lon="-121.816315"><ele>1448.5</ele><name>High point by Wolf Camp Butte</name><desc>source: OSM NF 2613 node 5.29 mi from the divide, the road's local top, DEM 4,752 ft; 130 m from the OSM Wolf Camp Butte peak node; confidence: high; pdf_page: 154; book_elev_ft: 4750; quote: about 100 yards east of the tour high point</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.247962" lon="-121.849641"><ele>1452.6</ele><name>Last Ridge</name><desc>source: OSM NF 2613 node 7.89 mi from the divide, the road's top on Last Ridge, DEM 4,766 ft (sketch: high point 4,700); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 154; book_elev_ft: 4700; quote: the road loses 400 feet, then gains it back as it climbs to Last Ridge</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.255599" lon="-121.862410"><ele>1372.2</ele><name>End of Sherar Burn Road</name><desc>source: OSM end of NF 2613 at the Kinzel Lake Spur Trail #665A; DEM 4,502 ft; confidence: high; pdf_page: 154</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.252120" lon="-121.864631"><ele>1291.5</ele><name>Kinzel Lake</name><desc>source: OSM south end of Kinzel Lake Spur Trail #665A at the lake; DEM 4,237 ft; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 154; book_elev_ft: 4250; quote: A final descending traverse drops 450 feet to Kinzel Lake.</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Sherar Burn to Kinzel Lake</name><desc>1. Trillium Lake Sno-Park -&gt; Airstrip junction: osm (high), 0.48 mi | 2. Airstrip junction -&gt; Pioneer Graves junction: osm (medium), 0.52 mi | 3. Pioneer Graves junction -&gt; Westside Divide: osm (medium), 0.48 mi | 4. Westside Divide -&gt; Fir Tree Campground: osm (high), 3.71 mi | 5. Fir Tree Campground -&gt; High point by Wolf Camp Butte: osm (high), 1.57 mi | 6. High point by Wolf Camp Butte -&gt; Last Ridge: osm (high), 2.60 mi | 7. Last Ridge -&gt; End of Sherar Burn Road: osm (high), 1.08 mi | 8. End of Sherar Burn Road -&gt; Kinzel Lake: osm (medium), 0.28 mi</desc>
